Ownership & purpose	
1	current business/technical owner? 
2	What business function or process does this app support?
Criticality	
3	Business impact if the app is unavailable? (Critical / High / Med / Low)
4	Max tolerable downtime (RTO) and acceptable data loss (RPO)?
5	Does it directly support revenue, safety, or legal/regulatory obligations?
Data & compliance	
6	What data does it hold? (PII / PHI / PCI-financial / confidential / public)
7	Is it subject to compliance? (SOX / PCI / HIPAA / GDPR / other)
Hosting & infrastructure	
8	Where is the app hosted? (On-premises / Private cloud / Public cloud / SaaS / Vendor-hosted)
9	If cloud or SaaS, which provider & product? (Azure / AWS / GCP / vendor name)
10	Server / host details (server names, OS, IP/URL) if on-prem or IaaS
11	Hosting / data location (region or country) — any data-residency requirements?
12	Is it internally managed or vendor-managed? Vendor / support contact?
13	Which environments exist? (Prod / Test / Dev / DR)
Access & identity	
14	Approx. number of users? Number of privileged / admin users?
15	How do users sign in? (Entra SSO / MFA / local accounts / legacy auth)
16	Is it integrated with AD / Entra, or does it keep its own local user directory?
17	Is access managed through SailPoint today? (Yes / No / Partial)
18	Are privileged / admin credentials vaulted in Delinea? (Yes / No)
19	Does it use service / non-human accounts or automation agents? List them.
20	Are there shared / generic / default or break-glass accounts?
21	Do any third parties / vendors have access? How is that access managed?
22	Is the application internet-facing / externally accessible?
Lifecycle & roadmap	
23	How is access granted & removed today? (manual / automated JML)
24	Who approves access requests for this app today?
25	When was access last reviewed or certified?
26	Is the app scheduled for upgrade, migration, or decommission?
